---
// No props — copy is deliberately fixed per spec (Mike to refine)
---

<section class="bg-offwhite py-[var(--space-section)] px-4">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">

      <!-- Left: persona bullets -->
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-teal mb-4">
          Who this is for
        </p>
        <h2
          class="font-serif text-navy leading-tight mb-8"
          style="font-size: var(--fs-h2);"
        >
          Best for parents who…
        </h2>

        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-5">
          <li class="flex gap-4 items-start">
            <span class="shrink-0 text-gold mt-1" style="font-size: 1.1rem;" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
            <p class="text-ink leading-relaxed" style="font-size: var(--fs-body);">
              Have tried interventions and tutors and nothing stuck
            </p>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-4 items-start">
            <span class="shrink-0 text-gold mt-1" style="font-size: 1.1rem;" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
            <p class="text-ink leading-relaxed" style="font-size: var(--fs-body);">
              Can see their child's gifts but don't know how to activate them at home
            </p>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-4 items-start">
            <span class="shrink-0 text-gold mt-1" style="font-size: 1.1rem;" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
            <p class="text-ink leading-relaxed" style="font-size: var(--fs-body);">
              Want a system they can run without a PhD in special education
            </p>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: credibility stat -->
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center md:justify-end">
        <div class="text-center max-w-xs">
          <p
            class="font-serif text-navy leading-snug"
            style="font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);"
          >
            "35 years.<br />Thousands of families.<br />One system."
          </p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-muted text-sm font-medium">— Mike Johnson, learning support educator</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
